// Benefit series - principle level (computation - wave 3-4 packages):
// CF (L. 522-1/2/3), ASF (L. 523-1/2/3), non-cumul (L. 532-1/2),
// prime a la naissance (L. 533-1), AEEH (L. 541-1/2/4/5), ARS (L. 543-1/2,
// D. 552-7 - in scope), AJPP (L. 544-1/2/3/4/6/7/8/9/10), forfait deces
// (L. 545-1), prets (L. 542-9), maintien apres deces (L. 552-7).
// Amounts, taux and plafonds - unpinned decrees/arretes: boundaries,
// computation - fr.pf.* wave 3-4 packages. Here - filter conditions, count limits
// (310 jours AJPP), dates (ARS apres 1er juin), defeaters, powers.
//
// DEONTIC MAP:
// - L. 541-2 (CDAPH) - decision fact: adjudicated (section 73 channel, as APL R. 822-13).
// - L. 542-9 "peuvent accorder" - fund liberty (prets).
// - L. 544-10 - duty to inform (AJPP claimant -> AEEH/PCH).
// - L. 523-1 III "de plein droit" (RSA L. 262-9) - status, computed by fr.casf.rsa.
// - L. 552-7 - maintien: structure; decree duree - boundary (case
//   renvoi-maintien-deces-duree-manquante records the absence of conclusion).

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.pf.core version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:fr:corpus:clir:pf-core";

